    "Activity streak" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "سلسلة أيام النشاط"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Ad-Duri took his name from ad-Dur, a district of Baghdad. He is the only narrator among the twenty who transmits two of the ten readings: Abu Amr's, through al-Yazidi, and al-Kisai's, on whom he read directly." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "نُسب الدوري إلى الدُّور، محلّة ببغداد. وهو الراوي الوحيد بين الرواة العشرين الذي يروي قراءتين من القراءات العشر: قراءة أبي عمرو بواسطة اليزيدي، وقراءة الكسائي الذي قرأ عليه مباشرة."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Adam" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "آدم"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState" : "manual"
    },
    "Adapted with credit from Proving Islam: provingislam.net’s “The Complete Case” and the proof articles of provingislam.com by Mohammad Baqer. The wording here is this app’s own, and every ayah and hadith is quoted from the Quran and hadith collections bundled with it, sahih or hasan only." : {},
    "Add Current Surah to Queue" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "إضافة السورة الحالية إلى قائمة الانتظار"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Add Note" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "إضافة ملاحظة"
          }
