    "Consistency" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "المداومة"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Consistency across a session is part of every rule that offers a choice." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "والاطّراد في المجلس الواحد جزء من كلّ حكم فيه تخيير."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Consistency is part of the rule, not a matter of taste. Two lengths in one reading is one of the fastest things a teacher hears." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "الاطّراد جزء من الحكم لا مسألة ذوق. ووجود مقدارين في تلاوة واحدة من أسرع ما يلتقطه الشيخ بسمعه."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Consistency matters more than length. 4 everywhere is better than random 2-6." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "والالتزام أهمّ من المقدار. فأربع حركات في كل موضع خير من التنقّل بين حركتين وستّ بلا ضابط."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Consistency matters more than length: four everywhere is better than a random two to six." : {
