    "English:" : {},
    "Enhancing Spiritual Connection: Many Muslims find that reciting the Quran with Tajweed enhances their spiritual experience. The attention to detail required encourages mindfulness and deeper reflection on the meaning of the verses, making your recitation more immersive and meaningful." : {},
    "Enjoining Good" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
