    },
    "Example of a dangerous stop:" : {},
    "Example recitations play in the app's current reciter. Curriculum by Jamil Hammoudeh for Tilawa, used with permission." : {},
    "Example:" : {},
    "Example: =Allah & mercy%" : {},
    "Example: ٱئۡتُونِي → iʾtūnī when starting." : {},
    "Examples" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
