    },
    "Honoring the Quran" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "تعظيم القرآن"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Honoring the Quran: The Quran is the final revelation from Allah. Reciting it with care and precision is a form of respect and reverence for the sacred text. By learning Tajweed, you follow the Prophet ﷺ who recited with the utmost clarity and eloquence." : {},
    "Hope" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "الرجاء"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Hope in Allah's Mercy" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "الرجاء في رحمة الله"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "House → houses (broken plural)" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "بيت ← بيوت (جمع تكسير)"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "House: a fatha before the yaa, so it glides (\"ay\") instead of stretching" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "بيت: قبل الياء فتحة، فهي ياء لين («بَيْ») لا تُمدّ"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How Arabic is printed everywhere except the mushaf." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "كيف تُطبع العربية في كل مكان إلا المصحف."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How It Looks" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "كيف يبدو"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How Letters Join" : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "الحروف المركبة"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "How Long Is It Held?" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
