    "Try again" : {},
    "Try another sky" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "جرّب سماءً أخرى"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try another word, or clear the filter." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "جرّب كلمة أخرى، أو امسح عامل التصفية."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try to find a reciter whose voice you genuinely enjoy listening to. Developing a connection with a reciter often deepens your love for the Quran and increases your motivation to recite. However, do not listen passively." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "واجتهد أن تجد قارئًا تأنس حقًّا بسماع صوته. فالأُلفة مع قارئ كثيرًا ما تعمّق حبك للقرآن وتزيد همّتك في التلاوة. غير أنه لا ينبغي أن تستمع استماعًا سلبيًّا."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Try to find a reciter whose voice you genuinely enjoy listening to. Developing a connection with a reciter often deepens your love for the Quran and increases your motivation to recite. However, do not listen passively. Instead, actively engage with the recitation:" : {},
    "Try to hold each one. The first runs as long as your air; the second cannot be held at all." : {
      "extractionState" : "manual",
      "localizations" : {
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "حاول أن تمد كل واحد منهما. الأول يجري ما جرى نفسك، والثاني لا يمتد البتة."
          }
        }
      }
    },
